Application under test: https://www.saucedemo.com

Environment: Chrome (current stable), macOS / Windows, 1440x900; mobile checks at 375x667

Author: QA Engineer, portfolio project | Version 1.0 | Day 02

1. Rules Under Test
Sauce Demo publishes no formal field rules. These realistic rules were assumed so that formal techniques could be applied. Differences from observed behavior are tracked as requirement questions or defect candidates.

Rule ID	Field	Rule Under Test (Assumed)	Sauce Demo Enforces
R-USR	Username	Required; exact, case-sensitive match to active user account.	Required; exact match to demo accounts.
R-PWD	Password	Required; exact, case-sensitive match (secret_sauce).	Required; exact match (secret_sauce).
R-FN	First Name	Required; 1–50 chars; letters, spaces, hyphens, apostrophes.	Non-empty only.
R-LN	Last Name	Required; 1–50 chars; same character set as First Name.	Non-empty only.
R-ZIP	Zip/Postal Code	Required; exactly 5 digits; numeric value range 00501–99950.	Non-empty only.
R-CART	Cart	1–6 items required to check out (quantity fixed at 1 each).	Empty cart allowed at checkout (verify).
2. Equivalence Partitioning (EP)
A. Login Module
Username (R-USR)
Valid Partition: standard_user, problem_user, performance_glitch_user, error_user, visual_user (Password: secret_sauce) 
→ Logs in successfully (/inventory.html).

Invalid Partitions:

Unregistered username (guest_user) 
→ Error: Username and password do not match any user in this service.

Blank input 
→ Error: Username is required.

Case mismatch (Standard_User) 
→ Rejected under exact case rule.

Leading/trailing spaces ( standard_user) 
→ Rejected (no silent trimming).

Locked-Out Partition: locked_out_user 
→ Valid credentials, restricted account state. Error: Sorry, this user has been locked out.

Password (R-PWD)
Valid Partition: secret_sauce 
→ Navigates to Products page.

Invalid Partitions:

Incorrect password (wrong_sauce) 
→ Error: Username and password do not match...

Case mismatch (Secret_Sauce) 
→ Rejected.

Blank input 
→ Error: Password is required.

Trailing space (secret_sauce ) 
→ Rejected.

B. Checkout Step One
First & Last Name (R-FN / R-LN)
Valid Partitions: Standard letters (Alex), Hyphenated/Apostrophes (Mary-Jane, O'Neil), Accented characters (José).

Invalid Partitions (Spec vs. Observed):

Blank 
→ Rejected (Error: First Name is required / Last Name is required).

Whitespace only (   ) 
→ Observed Accepted (treated as non-empty).

