ST-01	S0 → S1 → S2 → S3 → S4 → S5 → S1	Happy Path: Order placed successfully; cart badge cleared upon clicking Back Home.
ST-02	S3 → S3 (Error) → S4	Validation Recovery: Trigger missing field error on Step 1, supply valid data, proceed.
