- **Issue ID:** BUG-010
- **Title:** `[Checkout] Postal Code field lacks character set and boundary length validation`
- **Component:** Checkout Step One (`/checkout-step-one.html`)
- **Severity:** Medium
- **Priority:** High
- **Environment:** Chrome 129.0, Desktop / Mobile

### Preconditions
